# Hub — Project Context

## What Is Hub

Unified platform for dev teams (10-50 people): Task Tracker + Messenger + TMS + Voice Calls + Dashboards. Replaces Jira + Slack + TestRail + Zoom + Grafana.

**Monorepo layout:**
```
hub/
├── backend/          # Go 1.24 + Fiber v3
│   ├── cmd/server/   # main.go (thin entry; wiring in wiring_*.go)
│   ├── ent/schema/   # 82 Ent schemas
│   └── internal/     # 31+ modules: auth, project, tracker, sprint,
│                     # messenger, tms, calls, dashboard, notification,
│                     # search, github, gitlab, rbac, storage, imex,
│                     # backup, audit, apigateway, ws, ai, crm, intranet,
│                     # bases, accounting, marketplace, calendar, hr, platform
├── frontend/         # React 19 + TypeScript 5.7 + Vite
│   └── src/          # api/, components/, hooks/, modules/, routes/, stores/
├── cli/              # hub-cli (CI/CD utility)
├── deployments/      # Docker Compose + K3s manifests
└── docs/wiki/        # API.md, architecture, deploy docs
```

## Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|-------|-----------|
| Backend | Go 1.24, Fiber v3 (fasthttp) |
| ORM | Ent + Atlas migrations |
| Primary DB | PostgreSQL 17 |
| Document DB | MongoDB 8 (messages, Allure reports) |
| Cache/Sessions | Redis 7 |
| Messaging | NATS + JetStream |
| Real-time | WebSocket (Fiber built-in) |
| Voice/Video | LiveKit (WebRTC) |
| File Storage | SeaweedFS (S3-compatible) |
| Frontend | React 19, TypeScript 5.7, Vite |
| Routing | TanStack Router (39 routes) |
| State | TanStack Query + Zustand (11 stores) |
| UI | Shadcn/ui + Tailwind CSS 4 |
| Infra | Docker Compose (dev), K3s (prod), Caddy |

